      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DO RUN BANDI (2) skirted wide from an outside draw last start and found the front, leading throughout to win (19.93) at this track in a Mix 2/3 over 350m. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. In top form and looks a key chance again. KIA MCGRAW (3) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind QUICK BISCUIT (20.52) in a Mix 2/3. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from six starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. BOBBY BONUS (1) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only one length from the winner DO RUN BANDI in second(20.01) at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Will give a great sight again. ROCKY PEPPER (8) was in the money last start and poses a threat again.",
